  "body": "26 Whale Bay Rise SOLD — 3 Exceptional Homes Still Available\r\nThe highly sought-after 26 Whale Bay Rise, Gulf Harbour has now SOLD!  But there’s still an opportunity to secure your own piece of elevated Gulf Harbour living, with 3 stunning homes available to choose from.\r\nEnjoy elevated positions, beautiful marina views, high-spec finishes and thoughtfully designed spaces created for modern family living.\r\n\r\nOne has SOLD. Three more opportunities await.\r\nDiscover modern living at its finest at Gulf Harbour - a beautifully crafted, high-spec family home designed for comfort and style.\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nBrand New Build: Just completed, this quality home is ready for you to move in and make it your own.\r\nOpen-Plan Living: A bright, spacious living and dining area, complemented by a designer kitchen. Two sliding doors lead to a large wrap-around deck-perfect for entertaining.\r\nWarmth and Comfort: Insulated in the ceiling and walls, gas hot water system, plus a Central ducted heating and cooling heat pump system in the living ensures comfort all year round.\r\nPrivate Master Retreat:  the master suite boasts a tiled ensuite, walk-in wardrobe \r\nFamily-Friendly : Two double bedrooms with generous wardrobes and a stylish family bathroom.\r\nLight-Filled Design:  lights wells bring sunshine, warmth and modern flair to the home.\r\nExtra-Large A Carpeted Garage : Featuring an automatic door \r\nBeautifully finished grounds to complement the home's quality build.\r\nAffordable luxury awaits. \r\nDon't miss your chance to own this stunning new home. \r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nPLEASE NOTE: All Pictures shown are for illustration purpose only, Specified floor and land area sizes have been obtained from sources such as Vendor, RPNZ, Auckland Council (LIM) or Title documents. They have not been measured by the Salesperson or GARY QI Realty Limited. We recommend you seek your own independent legal advice if these sizes are material to your purchasing decision.",
